%h5 Library passes
%p.help-text
  Timed offers are free, staff-issued passes, so they are left out of the membership figures.
  Each pass counts once however many seats it admits; $ redeemed is the ticket value redeemed with
  passes in range.
.table-scroll
  %table.hover
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Offer
        %th Passes in range
        %th Passes active at end
        %th Orders paid with pass
        %th $ redeemed
    %tbody
      - ([results.passes] + results.pass_offers).each do |stats|
        %tr{ class: total_row_class(stats) }
          %td= stats.offer ? membership_offer_cell(stats.offer) : 'Passes'
          %td= stats.passes_in_range
          %td= stats.passes_active_at_end
          %td= stats.redeemed_orders
          %td= membership_money(stats.redeemed_amount)
